    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51572" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">zōnārĭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sōnārĭus</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		zona, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a belt</i> or <i>girdle.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sector,</span>”
				<i>a cutpurse</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 4, 2, 20</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">zōnārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m., <i>a maker of
			girdles</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Fl. 7, 17</span></i>; Lucil.
			ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 2, 379</span></i> (Sat. Fr. 30, 16).
				</div>
